+
+## Configuration
+
+Settings come from environment variables, so the same code runs locally and in production.
+
+| Variable | Local default | Production |
+|---|---|---|
+| `DJANGO_DEBUG` | debug on | `DJANGO_DEBUG=False` |
+| `DJANGO_SECRET_KEY` | a development key (debug mode only) | required: a long random value, kept secret |
+| `DJANGO_ALLOWED_HOSTS` | `localhost,127.0.0.1` | the API's host names, comma-separated |
